{"unit_id": "Chloride233__dsh-cot-profile#feature-1", "repo": "Chloride233/dsh-cot-profile", "commit": "c6b5bb6ae56727c4c5c330f94f4ac5c09506e0ca", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-cot-profile 的功能「实时画像」：累计统计推理措辞、首行模式和块长，并与画像基线比较；数据不足或混合时显示不确定。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/projection.js:50-70", "lib/projection.js:126-150", "lib/analyzer.js:193-263"]}
{"unit_id": "Chloride233__dsh-cot-profile#feature-2", "repo": "Chloride233/dsh-cot-profile", "commit": "c6b5bb6ae56727c4c5c330f94f4ac5c09506e0ca", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-cot-profile 的功能「会话徽章和面板」：在会话头部显示当前画像状态和核心计数，并提供实时面板查看措辞指标、首行模式、置信度及画像距离；可配置浮动 overlay 或实验性 track 面板。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/client.js:435-470", "lib/client.js:477-590", "lib/index.js:62-71"]}
{"unit_id": "Chloride233__dsh-cot-profile#feature-3", "repo": "Chloride233/dsh-cot-profile", "commit": "c6b5bb6ae56727c4c5c330f94f4ac5c09506e0ca", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-cot-profile 的功能「记录与校准」：启用记录后按 turn/end 保存会话聚合指标，可选追加到 JSONL；设置界面可读取记录，按 provider、model、preset 分组计算均值，并由用户选择应用为自定义画像。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:332-380", "lib/calibrate.js:51-123", "lib/client.js:745-766"]}
{"unit_id": "Chloride233__dsh-cot-profile#feature-4", "repo": "Chloride233/dsh-cot-profile", "commit": "c6b5bb6ae56727c4c5c330f94f4ac5c09506e0ca", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-cot-profile 的功能「指标判断配置」：用户可设置判断所需推理块数、指标权重和画像向量，选择是否显示徽章、面板及记录事件。内置判断会把低置信度、双指标升高或没有指标的轨迹标为混合/不确定。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:46-80", "lib/analyzer.js:155-263"]}
{"unit_id": "Chloride233__dsh-cot-profile#caveat-1", "repo": "Chloride233/dsh-cot-profile", "commit": "c6b5bb6ae56727c4c5c330f94f4ac5c09506e0ca", "type": "caveat", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-cot-profile 使用前须知：启用文件记录后，聚合指标会追加到配置的本地 JSONL 文件；默认关闭，不记录原始 reasoning 文本（见 lib/index.js:332-367）。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/index.js:332-367"]}
